      "id": "C14",
      "title_zh": "生成对选择的递归影响",
      "title_en": "Recursive influence of generation on selection",
      "claim_zh": "活动后果可改变后继形成与下一轮选择条件，贡献变体不必获益。重构、发育、留存和聚合研究区分遗传群体与运输集合；新的细菌谱系及逐管回复实验接通遗传切换和实际周期完成，信用常规解释。",
      "claim_en": "Consequences can change successor formation and later selection without guaranteeing contributor advantage. Reconstruction, development, retention and aggregation distinguish inherited clusters from transport groups. New bacterial genealogy and linked reversion assays connect inherited switching to realized cycle completion, crediting conventional explanation.",
