      "scope_en": "Preserves 16/26, 19/41, 7/13 and 6/6 theorem/audit results and counterexamples; no new theorem this round. The 54 videos/18 technical replicates, 33/190 sensitivity, 3,808 records/3,600 links and 42/72 versus 7/72 retain their scopes. New forecasts test 3,424 later outcomes, retaining constant-model exceptions. Independent mechanism calibration, broad comparison and support renewal remain open.",
